      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On my Wacom Intuos, mouse mode does work but only in menus. It gets stuck and just kind of jitters in place when trying to move the camera.\n\nHowever, it is able to control the camera if you use pen mode. It's usable and better than nothing, but it would still be great to get mouse mode working since pen mode is kind of limited.",
