  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-16T00:43:46.577Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Tablets don't work at all in VRChat. For those of us who don't have VR, tablets would be very comfortable devices to use. It acts as a mouse and can be used instead of one. Implementing this feature would improve the gaming experience considerably.\n\nPros:\n- Like every developing game VRChat should be interested in implementing more useful features which improve the gaming experience for players\n- Possibility of using a tablet would be especially useful for lecturers who make periodic lectures in some fields (it's really a thing)\n- It would be wonderful for people who don't talk much, but write a lot in VRChat\n- It would be really great for those who just like to draw\n- It would be also amazing for PC players who don't have VR (a tablet is easier to use than a mouse)\n- It's really easy to implement since a tablet works like a mouse and mouse support has already been inplemented\n- People would love you for it and you would bathe in glory\n- Just ask your designers if they like this idea\n\nCons:\n- It needs some minor programming\n\nPlease, we really need it.",
  "error": null,
